WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.698
The wish smoke led to a picnic spot.

2
00:00:06.699 --> 00:00:10.486
Kids in party hats were eating cake.

3
00:00:10.487 --> 00:00:15.236
"It looks like a family party," Hob whispered.

4
00:00:15.237 --> 00:00:18.943
"Maybe those guests are Mark's cousins."

5
00:00:18.944 --> 00:00:22.057
Bumble frowned as he looked around.

6
00:00:22.058 --> 00:00:42.404
"I hope we can find a good wishbit."

7
00:00:42.405 --> 00:00:49.263
Feather gasped. "The kid in the red party hat—Bruce!"

8
00:00:49.264 --> 00:00:52.340
Tears sprang to Bumble's eyes.

9
00:00:52.341 --> 00:00:57.304
"Oh no! Bruce will try to catch us!"

10
00:00:57.305 --> 00:01:03.068
Sprite patted Bumble's back. "We'll be careful, Bumble."

11
00:01:03.069 --> 00:01:07.550
Hob nodded. "It'll probably be fine."

12
00:01:07.551 --> 00:01:13.428
Bruce burped loudly. "More cake, Mark!"

13
00:01:13.429 --> 00:01:19.022
Mark laughed. "You always want more cake, Bruce.

14
00:01:19.023 --> 00:01:23.242
Help yourself—we're going to play tag."

15
00:01:23.243 --> 00:01:26.300
Mark rushed away with some other kids.

16
00:01:26.301 --> 00:01:35.032
As he ran, a piece of cloth fell from his pocket.

17
00:01:35.033 --> 00:01:40.215
"Yes!" Hob said. "We can use that for a wishbit."

18
00:01:40.216 --> 00:01:44.022
Feather made a face. "Yuck!

19
00:01:44.023 --> 00:01:48.222
It's probably a dirty handkerchief."

20
00:01:48.223 --> 00:01:51.171
"I'll get it," Sprite said.

21
00:01:51.172 --> 00:01:56.938
Bumble bit his lip. "How will you get past Bruce?"

22
00:01:56.939 --> 00:02:00.801
"Hmm," Sprite said.

23
00:02:00.802 --> 00:02:03.594
Bruce was eating more cake.

24
00:02:03.595 --> 00:02:07.271
The piece of cloth lay near to his foot.

25
00:02:07.272 --> 00:02:10.569
Sprite looked around.

26
00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:14.718
"Do you see anything else for a wishbit?"

27
00:02:14.719 --> 00:02:17.616
The others shook their heads.

28
00:02:17.617 --> 00:02:22.593
Sprite shrugged. "I guess I have to fly over then."

29
00:02:22.594 --> 00:02:28.495
She took off, zipping toward the cloth.

30
00:02:28.496 --> 00:02:32.953
"Mmm, this cake is good!" Bruce said.

31
00:02:32.954 --> 00:02:35.646
He reached for another slice.

32
00:02:35.647 --> 00:02:40.362
"Now!" Sprite thought, darting toward the cloth.

33
00:02:40.363 --> 00:02:43.361
Suddenly Bruce yelped.

34
00:02:43.362 --> 00:02:46.767
"Ow! I just got stung by a bug."

35
00:02:46.768 --> 00:02:56.785
Bruce bent down to check his ankle—and saw Sprite!

36
00:02:56.786 --> 00:03:01.189
"A fairy!" Bruce cried.

37
00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:04.920
"Oh no!" Bumble whispered.

38
00:03:04.921 --> 00:03:08.673
"Sprite needs our help!" Feather said.

39
00:03:08.674 --> 00:03:15.496
The three fairies shot toward Sprite.

40
00:03:15.497 --> 00:03:24.254
Sprite flew at Bruce, flapping her wings furiously.

41
00:03:24.255 --> 00:03:27.946
"Get the wishbit!" she yelled to the others.

42
00:03:27.947 --> 00:03:38.595
"I'll meet you at the Wish Factory!"

